# Larry builds: user-owned

The user manages Larry builds with `go/larry/build.ps1`. Do **not** run `build.ps1`, `go build`, or other Larry binary rebuilds unless a compile is needed to verify a change during testing.

When the user asks to commit and/or push Larry (`go/larry`) changes:

- Stage and commit already-modified binaries if present (`go/larry/bin/**`), same as other tools — do not exclude them as unrelated.
- Do **not** rebuild first to “refresh” binaries for the commit; use whatever the user already built.
- Prefer including modified binaries in the same commit as the related source/docs when they are already present in the working tree.
